Thali Code
==========

Thali Code is a Thali-configured distribution of OpenCode. It runs the OpenCode
engine from source, pointed at Thali (https://thaliai.in), with a provider
configuration, an installer, and a small branding change (the terminal splash
logo shows "THALI CODE"). The coding agent itself is OpenCode, used under its MIT
license — which permits modification and redistribution — reproduced below.

Thali-authored parts of this repository (the installer, the Thali provider
config, the `thali-code` wrapper, and this documentation) are © 2026 Thali Tech
Pvt Ltd, released under the MIT License (see LICENSE).

